---
import Layout from '../components/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="All about App School"
	pubDate={new Date('Apr 08 2025')}
	heroImage="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1603515161074-3206aaeb03f2?q=80&w=940&auto=format&fit=crop"
>
	 <p class="mb-4">
      Welcome to <strong>App School</strong>, your go-to platform for learning how to build apps from scratch! 
      Designed specifically for absolute beginners, we make app development accessible, fun, and straightforward.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4">
      At App School, we believe anyone can learn to code. Our step-by-step tutorials, hands-on projects, 
      and supportive community guide you through the process of creating your own mobile and web applications, 
      no prior experience required.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Our mission is to empower beginners with the skills and confidence to bring their app ideas to life. 
      Whether you're dreaming of building the next big app or just curious about coding, App School is here to help you every step of the way.
    </p>
    <p>
      Join us today and start your app-building journey!
    </p>
</Layout>
